Hi Team Member,

You set up F5Bot about a week ago, but your keywords haven't matched
anything yet. Sometimes that just means nobody is talking about your
topic right now, but often a small tweak makes all the difference.
A few things that usually help:

- Add variations and common misspellings of your brand or product
  name. Not everyone spells it correctly.

- Add your website domain (like example.com). That catches people
  sharing links to your site even when they don't name it.

- Watch your competitors and your product category, not just your own
  name. Questions about the category are your best chance to be
  helpful and get noticed.

- Very long or specific phrases almost never match exactly. Shorter,
  natural terms find more.

Review your keywords here:
https://f5bot.com/dash

If you want more ideas, take a look at the guides:
https://f5bot.com/guides

And if you're stuck, just hit reply and I'll take a look personally.

Thanks,
The F5Bot Team
F5Bot LLC

--447185a6ed121891c738c62a2ca32e7e
